{"4589440": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Accurate Jet Injection", "steam_appid": 4589440, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master precise movement with jet propulsion in this arcade-style score attack action game.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Accurate Jet Injection</i> takes place in a minimal, futuristic zero-gravity space.<br>Control a robot with simple inputs, reach the goal, and push for a better score every time you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim your thrust with the left and right sticks, then fire with a single button.<br>Adjust your posture and trajectory as you move through zero gravity with precise, momentum-based control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To earn a high score, you will need speed, precision, and efficiency.<br>Should you save thrusts, or finish faster?<br>Study the score breakdown after each run, refine your play, and search for the best possible route.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized 3D visuals and digital sound help bring this cold, futuristic zero-gravity world to life.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick 5-minute score attack sessions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precise momentum-based movement using jet propulsion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A scoring system that rewards speed, control, and efficiency</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online rankings for high-score competition</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized 3D visuals, UI, and digital sound in a futuristic zero-gravity setting</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master precise movement with jet propulsion in this arcade-style score attack action game.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Accurate Jet Injection</i> takes place in a minimal, futuristic zero-gravity space.<br>Control a robot with simple inputs, reach the goal, and push for a better score every time you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim your thrust with the left and right sticks, then fire with a single button.<br>Adjust your posture and trajectory as you move through zero gravity with precise, momentum-based control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To earn a high score, you will need speed, precision, and efficiency.<br>Should you save thrusts, or finish faster?<br>Study the score breakdown after each run, refine your play, and search for the best possible route.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized 3D visuals and digital sound help bring this cold, futuristic zero-gravity world to life.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick 5-minute score attack sessions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precise momentum-based movement using jet propulsion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A scoring system that rewards speed, control, and efficiency</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online rankings for high-score competition</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized 3D visuals, UI, and digital sound in a futuristic zero-gravity setting</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Use jet propulsion to guide a robot through a zero-gravity space, master precise movement, and chase high scores in this arcade action game.", "supported_languages": "Japanese, English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4589440/c285b962d2105cf52c2ae5f7ba71255cc391c3bf/header.jpg?t=1775914641", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4589440/0ab26cac3a1875e4ee17cb36c6f956e1db17b48b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1775914641", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4589440/0ab26cac3a1875e4ee17cb36c6f956e1db17b48b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1775914641", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">